3 5.5 9.8 6.1A7 7 0 0011 20\"></path><path d=\"M2 21a5 5 0 012.911-4.544C7.613 15.212 8.351 15.24 11 13\"></path></svg>No preservatives</li><li class=\"glass-pill flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full px-3.5 py-1.5 text-xs font-bold text-foreground\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clock h-4 w-4 text-accent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 6v6l4 2\"></path></svg>Ready in minutes</li></ul></div><div class=\"relative group\"><div class=\"absolute -inset-1 rounded-[2.5rem] bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500/20 to-emerald-500/20 blur-xl transition-all group-hover:blur-2xl opacity-70\"></div><img alt=\"A rustic bowl of Patal Poha Chivda garnished with peanuts and curry leaves\" fetchPriority=\"high\" width=\"1200\" height=\"1200\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"relative aspect-square w-full rounded-[2.2rem] border border-white/70 object-cover shadow-2xl backdrop-blur-xl dark:border-white/10\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/images/hero-chivda.webp\"/><div class=\"glass-panel absolute bottom-5 left-5 rounded-2xl p-4 shadow-2xl\"><p class=\"font-heading text-sm font-extrabold text-foreground\">Patal Poha Chivda</p><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-muted-foreground\">200 g · ₹90</p></div></div></div></section><section id=\"products\" class=\"relative scroll-mt-20 py-16 md:py-24\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 sm:px-6\"><div class=\"mx-auto mb-12 max-w-2xl text-center\"><span class=\"glass-pill rounded-full px-4 py-1.5 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-primary shadow-xs\">Our Range</span><h2 class=\"mt-4 text-balance font-heading text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-foreground sm:text-4xl\">Snacks &amp; instant premixes</h2><p class=\"mt-3 text-pretty text-muted-foreground\">Freshly made in small batches. Tap add to cart and order securely online.</p></div><div class=\"grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3\"><article class=\"glass-card group flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-[2.2rem]\"><div class=\"relative aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden bg-secondary/50\"><img alt=\"Patal Poha Chivda\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"960\" height=\"720\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"block aspect-[4/3] h-auto w-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/images/patal-poha-chivda.webp\"/><span class=\"glass-pill absolute left-3.5 top-3.5 rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold text-accent shadow-md\">Bestseller</span></div><div class=\"flex flex-1 flex-col gap-3.5 p-6\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1\"><h3 class=\"font-heading text-xl font-extrabold text-foreground\">Patal Poha Chivda</h3><p class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-primary\">Our signature crunchy classic</p></div><p class=\"flex-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">Thin, crisp flattened rice tossed with roasted peanuts, curry leaves and a delicate turmeric-spice blend. A light, moreish tea-time snack made the traditional way.</p><details class=\"group/details glass-pill rounded-2xl transition-all\"><summary class=\"flex w-full cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-2 rounded-2xl px-4 py-3 text-left\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-bold text-foreground\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chef-hat h-4 w-4 text-primary\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M17 21a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-5.35c0-.457.316-.844.727-1.041a4 4 0 0 0-2.134-7.589 5 5 0 0 0-9.186 0 4 4 0 0 0-2.134 7.588c.411.198.727.585.727 1.041V20a1 1 0 0 0 1 1Z\"></path><path d=\"M6 17h12\"></path></svg>Serving &amp; storage</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-300 group-open/details:rotate-180\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><ol class=\"flex list-none flex-col gap-2.5 px-4 pb-4 pt-1 border-t border-white/40 dark:border-white/10\"><li class=\"flex gap-2.5 text-xs text-muted-foreground\"><span class=\"flex h-5 w-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary text-[11px] font-extrabold text-primary-foreground shadow-sm\">1</span><span class=\"leading-relaxed\">Ready to eat — no cooking needed. Just open and enjoy.</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-2.5 text-xs text-muted-foreground\"><span class=\"flex h-5 w-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary text-[11px] font-extrabold text-primary-foreground shadow-sm\">2</span><span class=\"leading-relaxed\">Pairs perfectly with a cup of chai or coffee.</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-2.5 text-xs text-muted-foreground\"><span class=\"flex h-5 w-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary text-[11px] font-extrabold text-primary-foreground shadow-sm\">3</span><span class=\"leading-relaxed\">Reseal the pack tightly after opening to keep it crisp.</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-2.5 text-xs text-muted-foreground\"><span class=\"flex h-5 w-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary text-[11px] font-extrabold text-primary-foreground shadow-sm\">4</span><span class=\"leading-relaxed\">Store in a cool, dry place away from direct sunlight.</span></li></ol></details><div class=\"mt-2 flex items-center justify-between gap-3 border-t border-white/40 pt-4 dark:border-white/10\"><div class=\"flex flex-col\"><span class=\"font-heading text-2xl font-black tracking-tight text-foreground\">₹<!-- -->90</span><span class=\"text-[11px] font-medium text-muted-foreground\">200 g<!-- --> pack</span></div><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Add Patal Poha Chivda to order\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full bg-primary px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-primary-foreground transition-transform hover:scale-[1.03] active:scale-95\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-plus h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"M12 5v14\"></path></svg>Add to order</button></div></div></article><article class=\"glass-card group flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-[2.2rem]\"><div class=\"relative aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden bg-secondary/50\"><img alt=\"Instant Kanda Poha Premix\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"960\" height=\"720\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"block aspect-[4/3] h-auto w-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/images/kanda-poha.webp\"/><span class=\"glass-pill absolute left-3.5 top-3.5 rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold text-accent shadow-md\">Ready in 5 min</span></div><div class=\"flex flex-1 flex-col gap-3.5 p-6\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1\"><h3 class=\"font-heading text-xl font-extrabold text-foreground\">Instant Kanda Poha Premix</h3><p class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-primary\">Maharashtra&#x27;s favourite breakfast, in minutes</p></div><p class=\"flex-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">Everything you need for authentic Kanda Poha in one pack. Just add hot water, rest, and enjoy a soft, fragrant breakfast with onions, chilies and turmeric.</p><details class=\"group/details glass-pill rounded-2xl transition-all\"><summary class=\"flex w-full cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-2 rounded-2xl px-4 py-3 text-left\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-bold text-foreground\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chef-hat h-4 w-4 text-primary\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M17 21a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-5.35c0-.457.316-.844.727-1.041a4 4 0 0 0-2.134-7.589 5 5 0 0 0-9.186 0 4 4 0 0 0-2.134 7.588c.411.198.727.585.727 1.041V20a1 1 0 0 0 1 1Z\"></path><path d=\"M6 17h12\"></path></svg>How to prepare</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-300 group-open/details:rotate-180\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><ol class=\"flex list-none flex-col gap-2.5 px-4 pb-4 pt-1 border-t border-white/40 dark:border-white/10\"><li class=\"flex gap-2.5 text-xs text-muted-foreground\"><span class=\"flex h-5 w-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary text-[11px] font-extrabold text-primary-foreground shadow-sm\">1</span><span class=\"leading-relaxed\">Empty the premix into a bowl.</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-2.5 text-xs text-muted-foreground\"><span class=\"flex h-5 w-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary text-[11px] font-extrabold text-primary-foreground shadow-sm\">2</span><span class=\"leading-relaxed\">Add hot boiling water equal to exactly half the amount of premix (1 part water to 2 parts premix).</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-2.5 text-xs text-muted-foreground\"><span class=\"flex h-5 w-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary text-[11px] font-extrabold text-primary-foreground shadow-sm\">3</span><span class=\"leading-relaxed\">Cover the bowl and let it rest.</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-2.5 text-xs text-muted-foreground\"><span class=\"flex h-5 w-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary text-[11px] font-extrabold text-primary-foreground shadow-sm\">4</span><span class=\"leading-relaxed\">It will be ready in 5 minutes. Fluff gently and serve.</span></li></ol></details><div class=\"mt-2 flex items-center justify-between gap-3 border-t border-white/40 pt-4 dark:border-white/10\"><div class=\"flex flex-col\"><span class=\"font-heading text-2xl font-black tracking-tight text-foreground\">₹<!-- -->70</span><span class=\"text-[11px] font-medium text-muted-foreground\">150 g<!-- --> pack</span></div><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Add Instant Kanda Poha Premix to order\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full bg-primary px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-primary-foreground transition-transform hover:scale-[1.03] active:scale-95\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-plus h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"M12 5v14\"></path></svg>Add to order</button></div></div></article><article class=\"glass-card group flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-[2.2rem]\"><div class=\"relative aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden bg-secondary/50\"><img alt=\"Instant Upma Premix\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"960\" height=\"720\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"block aspect-[4/3] h-auto w-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/images/upma.webp\"/><span class=\"glass-pill absolute left-3.5 top-3.5 rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold text-accent shadow-md\">Ready in 5 min</span></div><div class=\"flex flex-1 flex-col gap-3.5 p-6\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1\"><h3 class=\"font-heading text-xl font-extrabold text-foreground\">Instant Upma Premix</h3><p class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-primary\">Comforting South Indian classic</p></div><p class=\"flex-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">A savoury semolina premix with curry leaves, mustard and chilies. Add hot water for a warm, comforting upma anytime of the day.</p><details class=\"group/details glass-pill rounded-2xl transition-all\"><summary class=\"flex w-full cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-2 rounded-2xl px-4 py-3 text-left\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-bold text-foreground\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chef-hat h-4 w-4 text-primary\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M17 21a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-5.35c0-.457.316-.844.727-1.041a4 4 0 0 0-2.134-7.589 5 5 0 0 0-9.186 0 4 4 0 0 0-2.134 7.588c.411.198.727.585.727 1.041V20a1 1 0 0 0 1 1Z\"></path><path d=\"M6 17h12\"></path></svg>How to prepare</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-300 group-open/details:rotate-180\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><ol class=\"flex list-none flex-col gap-2.5 px-4 pb-4 pt-1 border-t border-white/40 dark:border-white/10\"><li class=\"flex gap-2.5 text-xs text-muted-foreground\"><span class=\"flex h-5 w-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary text-[11px] font-extrabold text-primary-foreground shadow-sm\">1</span><span class=\"leading-relaxed\">Empty the premix into a bowl.</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-2.5 text-xs text-muted-foreground\"><span class=\"flex h-5 w-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary text-[11px] font-extrabold text-primary-foreground shadow-sm\">2</span><span class=\"leading-relaxed\">Add hot boiling water equal to exactly the same amount as the premix (1 part water to 1 part premix).</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-2.5 text-xs text-muted-foreground\"><span class=\"flex h-5 w-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary text-[11px] font-extrabold text-primary-foreground shadow-sm\">3</span><span class=\"leading-relaxed\">Cover the bowl and let it rest.</span></li><li class=\"flex gap-2.5 text-xs text-muted-foreground\"><span class=\"flex h-5 w-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary text-[11px] font-extrabold text-primary-foreground shadow-sm\">4</span><span class=\"leading-relaxed\">It will be ready in 5 minutes. Fluff gently and serve.</span></li></ol></details><div class=\"mt-2 flex items-center justify-between gap-3 border-t border-white/40 pt-4 dark:border-white/10\"><div class=\"flex flex-col\"><span class=\"font-heading text-2xl font-black tracking-tight text-foreground\">₹<!-- -->70</span><span class=\"text-[11px] font-medium text-muted-foreground\">150 g<!-- --> pack</span></div><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Add Instant Upma Premix to order\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full bg-primary px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-primary-foreground transition-transform hover:scale-[1.03] active:scale-95\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-plus h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"M12 5v14\"></path></svg>Add to order</button></div></div></article></div></div></section><section id=\"about\" class=\"relative scroll-mt-20 py-16 md:py-24\"><div class=\"glass-panel mx-auto max-w-6xl rounded-[2.5rem] p-6 shadow-2xl sm:p-10 md:p-12\"><div class=\"grid items-center gap-10 md:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"relative order-last md:order-first group\"><div class=\"absolute -inset-1 rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500/20 to-orange-500/20 blur-lg transition-all group-hover:blur-xl\"></div><img alt=\"Freshly prepared Kanda Poha garnished with coriander and coconut\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1200\" height=\"900\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"relative aspect-[4/3] h-auto w-full rounded-3xl border border-white/70 object-cover shadow-xl backdrop-blur-xl dark:border-white/10\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/images/kanda-poha.webp\"/></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-5\"><span class=\"glass-pill w-fit rounded-full px-4 py-1.5 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-primary shadow-xs\">Our Story</span><h2 class=\"text-balance font-heading text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-foreground sm:text-4xl\">Home-style taste, made with care</h2><p class=\"text-pretty leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">Swadam Foods is a women-owned and women-operated business, born from a simple idea — bring the honest, home-style flavours of Indian snacks to busy kitchens everywhere.</p><p class=\"text-pretty leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">No shortcuts, no artificial flavours — just the authentic taste you grew up loving, ready whenever you are.</p><p class=\"text-pretty leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">Based in Pune, Maharashtra, we prepare every batch in small quantities to guarantee freshness. Our instant premixes are designed for busy households — simply add hot water, wait five minutes, and enjoy a home-style breakfast.</p><dl class=\"mt-2 grid grid-cols-3 gap-3 border-t border-white/40 pt-6 dark:border-white/10\"><div class=\"glass-pill rounded-2xl p-3 text-center\"><dt class=\"text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-muted-foreground\">Products</dt><dd class=\"font-heading text-2xl font-black text-foreground\">3</dd></div><div class=\"glass-pill rounded-2xl p-3 text-center\"><dt class=\"text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-muted-foreground\">Preservatives</dt><dd class=\"font-heading text-2xl font-black text-foreground\">Zero</dd></div><div class=\"glass-pill rounded-2xl p-3 text-center\"><dt class=\"text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-muted-foreground\">Made in</dt><dd class=\"font-heading text-2xl font-black text-foreground\">Pune</dd></div></dl></div></div></div></section><section id=\"trust\" class=\"relative scroll-mt-20 py-16 md:py-24\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 sm:px-6\"><div class=\"mx-auto mb-12 max-w-2xl text-center\"><span class=\"glass-pill rounded-full px-4 py-1.5 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-primary shadow-xs\">Why Swadam</span><h2 class=\"mt-4 text-balance font-heading text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-foreground sm:text-4xl\">Registered and ready to serve</h2><p class=\"mt-3 text-pretty text-muted-foreground\">Shop with confidence and see our business registration details at a glance.</p></div><div class=\"grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3\"><div class=\"glass-card flex flex-col rounded-[2.2rem] p-7\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-4\"><span class=\"flex h-13 w-13 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-accent/15 text-accent shadow-inner border border-accent/20\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-heart-handshake h-6 w-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M19.414 14.414C21 12.828 22 11.5 22 9.5a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-9.591-3.676.6.6 0 0 1-.818.001A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 2 9.5c0 2.3 1.5 4 3 5.5l5.535 5.362a2 2 0 0 0 2.879.052 2.12 2.12 0 0 0-.004-3 2.124 2.124 0 1 0 3-3 2.124 2.124 0 0 0 3.004 0 2 2 0 0 0 0-2.828l-1.881-1.882a2.41 2.41 0 0 0-3.409 0l-1.71 1.71a2 2 0 0 1-2.828 0 2 2 0 0 1 0-2.828l2.823-2.762\"></path></svg></span></div><h3 class=\"mt-5 font-heading text-xl font-extrabold text-foreground\">Women-Owned Business</h3><p class=\"mt-2 flex-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">Solely owned and run by a woman entrepreneur — every recipe and every batch is a labour of love.</p></div><div class=\"glass-card flex flex-col rounded-[2.2rem] p-7\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-4\"><span class=\"flex h-13 w-13 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-accent/15 text-accent shadow-inner border border-accent/20\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-badge-check lucide-verified h-6 w-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3.85 8.62a4 4 0 0 1 4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 6.74 0 4 4 0 0 1 4.78 4.78 4 4 0 0 1 0 6.74 4 4 0 0 1-4.77 4.78 4 4 0 0 1-6.75 0 4 4 0 0 1-4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 0-6.76Z\"></path><path d=\"m16 9-5.5 5.5L8 12\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"glass-pill rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-[10px] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-widest text-accent\">Verified</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-5 font-heading text-xl font-extrabold text-foreground\">UDYAM MSME Registered</h3><p class=\"mt-2 flex-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">A recognised Micro enterprise under the Government of India&#x27;s UDYAM registration.</p><div class=\"mt-6 glass-pill rounded-2xl p-4\"><p class=\"text-[10px] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-widest text-muted-foreground\">UDYAM<!-- --> Reg No.</p><p class=\"mt-1 break-all font-mono text-xs font-bold text-foreground\">UDYAM-MH-26-1188295</p></div></div><div class=\"glass-card flex flex-col rounded-[2.2rem] p-7\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-4\"><span class=\"flex h-13 w-13 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-accent/15 text-accent shadow-inner border border-accent/20\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check h-6 w-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"glass-pill rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-[10px] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-widest text-accent\">Verified</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-5 font-heading text-xl font-extrabold text-foreground\">FSSAI Registered</h3><p class=\"mt-2 flex-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">Registered with the Food Safety and Standards Authority of India for safe, hygienic food business operations.</p><div class=\"mt-6 glass-pill rounded-2xl p-4\"><p class=\"text-[10px] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-widest text-muted-foreground\">FSSAI<!-- --> Reg No.</p><p class=\"mt-1 break-all font-mono text-xs font-bold text-foreground\">21526080002094</p></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"faq\" class=\"relative scroll-mt-20 py-16 md:py-24\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 sm:px-6\"><div class=\"mb-12 text-center\"><span class=\"glass-pill rounded-full px-4 py-1.5 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-primary shadow-xs\">Questions &amp; Answers</span><h2 class=\"mt-4 text-balance font-heading text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-foreground sm:text-4xl\">Frequently asked questions</h2><p class=\"mt-3 text-pretty text-muted-foreground\">Everything you need to know about our Indian snacks and instant premixes.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\"><div class=\"glass-card rounded-3xl p-6\"><h3 class=\"font-heading text-lg font-extrabold text-foreground\">What products does Swadam Foods sell?</h3><p class=\"mt-2.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">We sell three products: Patal Poha Chivda (200 g, ₹90), a ready-to-eat crunchy flattened rice snack; Instant Kanda Poha Premix (150 g, ₹70), ready in 5 minutes with hot water; and Instant Upma Premix (150 g, ₹70), also ready in 5 minutes with hot water.</p></div><div class=\"glass-card rounded-3xl p-6\"><h3 class=\"font-heading text-lg font-extrabold text-foreground\">How do I prepare the Instant Kanda Poha Premix?</h3><p class=\"mt-2.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">Empty the premix into a bowl, add hot boiling water equal to exactly half the amount of premix (1 part water to 2 parts premix), cover the bowl and let it rest. It will be ready in 5 minutes. Fluff gently and serve.</p></div><div class=\"glass-card rounded-3xl p-6\"><h3 class=\"font-heading text-lg font-extrabold text-foreground\">How do I prepare the Instant Upma Premix?</h3><p class=\"mt-2.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">Empty the premix into a bowl, add hot boiling water equal to the same amount as the premix (1 part water to 1 part premix), cover the bowl and let it rest. It will be ready in 5 minutes. Fluff gently and serve.</p></div><div class=\"glass-card rounded-3xl p-6\"><h3 class=\"font-heading text-lg font-extrabold text-foreground\">How do I order from Swadam Foods?</h3><p class=\"mt-2.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">Add your favourite products to the cart on our website, then check out via WhatsApp. We confirm the order and arrange delivery. You can also message us directly on WhatsApp at +91 88888 51522.</p></div><div class=\"glass-card rounded-3xl p-6\"><h3 class=\"font-heading text-lg font-extrabold text-foreground\">Is Swadam Foods a registered business?</h3><p class=\"mt-2.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">Yes. We are FSSAI registered (license no. 21526080002094) and UDYAM MSME registered (UDYAM-MH-26-1188295). We are a women-owned and women-operated business based in Pune, Maharashtra.</p></div><div class=\"glass-card rounded-3xl p-6\"><h3 class=\"font-heading text-lg font-extrabold text-foreground\">Does Patal Poha Chivda need cooking?</h3><p class=\"mt-2.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">No, Patal Poha Chivda is ready to eat — just open the pack and enjoy. It pairs perfectly with a cup of chai or coffee. Reseal the pack tightly after opening to keep it crisp, and store in a cool, dry place away from direct sunlight.</p></div></div><p class=\"mt-10 text-center text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Still have questions?<!-- --> <a href=\"https://wa.me/918888851522\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"font-bold text-primary transition-colors hover:text-accent underline underline-offset-4\">Message us on WhatsApp</a> <!-- -->and we&#x27;ll be happy to help.</p></div></section></main><footer id=\"contact\" class=\"relative scroll-mt-20 border-t border-white/40 pt-8 dark:border-white/10\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6\"><div class=\"glass-panel relative overflow-hidden rounded-[2.5rem] p-8 text-center sm:p-12 shadow-2xl\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute -right-20 -top-20 h-64 w-64 rounded-full bg-primary/20 blur-3xl\"></div><div class=\"relative flex flex-col items-center gap-5\"><span class=\"glass-pill rounded-full px-4 py-1.5 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-primary shadow-xs\">Fast &amp; Fresh Delivery</span><h2 class=\"text-balance font-heading text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-foreground sm:text-4xl\">Ready to enjoy authentic home-style snacks?</h2><p class=\"max-w-md text-pretty text-sm text-muted-foreground sm:text-base\">Add your favourites to the cart and pay securely online. Need help with an order? Message us directly on WhatsApp.</p><a href=\"https://wa.me/918888851522?text=Hello%20Swadam%20Foods!%20I&#x27;d%20like%20to%20know%20more%20about%20your%20products.\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-primary px-7 py-3.5 text-sm font-extrabold text-primary-foreground shadow-xl shadow-primary/25 transition-transform hover:scale-[1.03] active:scale-95\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-message-circle h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M2.992 16.342a2 2 0 0 1 .094 1.167l-1.065 3.29a1 1 0 0 0 1.236 1.168l3.413-.998a2 2 0 0 1 1.099.092 10 10 0 1 0-4.777-4.719\"></path></svg> Chat on WhatsApp</a></div></div><div class=\"mt-14 grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-3\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\"><span class=\"w-fit overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-white/60 bg-[#f7f2e7]/90 p-2 shadow-sm\"><img alt=\"Swadam Foods logo\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"160\" height=\"80\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"h-14 w-auto\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/images/swadam-logo.webp\"/></span><p class=\"max-w-sm text-xs leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">Authentic Indian snacks and instant premixes, made with real ingredients and traditional recipes. Proudly a women-owned and women-operated business.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\"><span class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-primary\">Get in touch</span><a href=\"https://wa.me/918888851522\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-bold text-foreground transition-colors hover:text-primary\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-phone h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-accent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M13.832 16.568a1 1 0 0 0 1.213-.303l.355-.465A2 2 0 0 1 17 15h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3a2 2 0 0 1-2 2A18 18 0 0 1 2 4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3a2 2 0 0 1-.8 1.6l-.468.351a1 1 0 0 0-.292 1.23