entic Kanda Poha in one pack. Just add hot water, rest, and enjoy a soft, fragrant breakfast with onions, chilies and turmeric.\",\"image\":\"https://swadamfoods.eu.cc/images/kanda-poha.webp\",\"brand\":{\"@type\":\"Brand\",\"name\":\"Swadam Foods\"},\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":70,\"priceCurrency\":\"INR\",\"availability\":\"https://schema.org/InStock\"}}},{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"itemOffered\":{\"@type\":\"Product\",\"name\":\"Instant Upma Premix\",\"description\":\"A savoury semolina premix with curry leaves, mustard and chilies. Add hot water for a warm, comforting upma anytime of the day.\",\"image\":\"https://swadamfoods.eu.cc/images/upma.webp\",\"brand\":{\"@type\":\"Brand\",\"name\":\"Swadam Foods\"},\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":70,\"priceCurrency\":\"INR\",\"availability\":\"https://schema.org/InStock\"}}}]}},{\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"@id\":\"https://swadamfoods.eu.cc/#faq\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What products does Swadam Foods sell?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"We sell Patal Poha Chivda (200 g, ₹90), Instant Kanda Poha Premix (150 g, ₹70), and Instant Upma Premix (150 g, ₹70).\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How do I prepare the Instant Kanda Poha Premix?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Empty the premix into a bowl, add hot boiling water equal to half the amount of premix (1 part water to 2 parts premix), cover and rest for 5 minutes.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How do I prepare the Instant Upma Premix?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Empty the premix into a bowl, add hot boiling water equal to the same amount as the premix (1:1 ratio), cover and rest for 5 minutes.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How do I order from Swadam Foods?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Add products to the cart, complete the checkout form, and pay securely online. Payment is processed by PhonePe or, where used as an